#AREA Dragon Haven~

#AUTHORS Fizzo  ~

#HELPS
-1 DRAGON HAVEN DRAGONHAVEN~
The area has been designed, developed with the help of D&D Monster Manual.
I have been told to give credit to them and I did. Many of the mobs in the 
area cast nasty spells when fighting, some of them are a bit tough so be 
careful about what you do. The whole area supports one long quest to get a 
quite powerful item. Hope you appreciate my work. 

Fizzo
    (A) History
    (B) Special Thanx

{b}HAVENTHANX
{a}HAVENHISTORY
~
-1 HAVENHISTORY~
Long time ago dragons were the ruling race in the Realms, the were the
ones defending their own Gods, Chaos and Order. This until the greatest
war between the Army of Entropy and the Army of Reason almost led to the
extinction of the dragon race. The exemplars who managed to survive retired
from the battle. Evil dragons established their domain into a tower that is
well known by the majority of living beings, while lawful dragons decided to
hide themselves in a secret place to restore their power and to get ready for
the next war. In the meanwhile Chaos and Order, who lost their army of
followers, started recruiting among the lesser races almost forgetting about
dragons. Realizing that there was no need anymore to get ready for a war,
lawful dragons transformed a their secret refuge into a shining town. The
location of the town was unknown for everyone, until Chaos managed to
locate its whereabouts, taking advantage of a period of weakness accused by
his ancestral enemy, Order. The haven is now seriously threatened by a mighty
warrior, who received great powers by his master, sent there to destroy the
whole breed of lawful dragons.
   (-) Back
~
-1 HAVENTHANX~
Special Thanx to Redrum, Deadbolt, Panic and Rar for their help and support
and to Presto, Chaste and Calamir for their collaboration.
   (-) Back
~
0 $~

#RANGES 50 95 0 99

#MOBILES
#31101
platinum dragon~
The platinum dragon~
The Platinum Dragon is resting on his throne morphed in a human shape.~
This powerful dragon sits on an enormous throne morphed in the shape of
a bearded old man.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_SANCTUARY|AFF_INFRARED|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_PASS_DOOR|AFF_TONGUES
1000 S
130 BODY_EYE BODY_MOUTH|BODY_WING|BODY_TAIL|BODY_CLAW 100d150+10000 15d15+50
0 780605
POS_RESTING POS_RESTING SEX_NEUTRAL
>all_greet_prog 99~
if quest(6,1,$n) == 1
  bow $n
  break
endif
if actorhasobjnum(31150)
  if actorhasobjnum(31149)
    if quest(7,1,$n) == 1
      if quest(0,1,self) == 1
        tell $n Now give me the Rod with the gem mounted first and then
        tell $n The potion of soul caging.
        break
      endif
    endif
    tell $n Now that you have all the items required for the ritual we can proceed.
    tell $n Follow me, we have to be by the Well of Souls to succeed.
    mpmset $n quest 7 1 1
    mpmset self quest 0 1 1
    east 
    break
  endif
endif
if quest(5,1,$n) ==1
  tell $n Thanks to you our town will live for many centuries. I will never
  tell $n thank you enough. All I can do is to give my soul to you.
  tell $n Do you know how to CAGE the soul of a dragon?
  break
endif
if quest(3,1,$n) ==1
  tell $n Welcome in my Castle $n.
  tell $n I have been informed that you are seeking the soul of a Dragon.
else
  shout How did you dare, $n, to appear before me without permission?
  shout You'll be banned till you prove that you are worthy to stay here!
  mpforce $n recall reset
  mpforce $n recall
endif
~
>give_prog I31150~
if quest(7,1,$n) == 1
  if quest(0,1,self) == 1
    tell $n Good the rod is perfect. Now give me the potion.
    mpmset $n quest 8 1 1
  endif
endif
~
>give_prog I31149~
if quest(8,1,$n) == 1
  if quest(0,1,self) == 1
    tell $n OK! I have to warn you now that when I'll quaff the potion my
    tell $n Soul will be eradicated from my body and my bones will stay
    tell $n Alive to kill you. So be sure to have a few friends to help you
    tell $n Or you will die easily.
    tell $n When you think you are ready tell me to quaff the potion.
    tell $n And GOOD LUCK!
    mpmset $n quest 9 1 1 
  endif
~
>speech_prog quaff~
if quest(9,1,$n) == 1
  if hasobjnum(31149)
    if hasobjnum(31150)
      mpecho The Platinum Dragon quaffs the potion and dies immediately.
      mpecho His flesh quickly evaporates...
      mpecho ....
      mpecho ..
      mpecho 
      mpecho The skeleton of the platinum dragon suddenly takes life and attacks $n
      mpmload 31126
      mpforce spectral mpkill $n
      mpmset $n quest 6 1 1
      mpgoto 31199
      suicide 
    endif
  endif
endif
~
>speech_prog soul~
if quest(3,1,$n) == 1
  ponder 
  tell $n Hmmm... I know what you are looking for. I offer my own soul to you if
  tell $n help us banishing the most dangerous THREAT to our city that we had to
  tell $n face in the last centuries.
endif
~
>speech_prog cage~
if quest(5,1,$n) == 1
  tell $n Ok! You need 3 things:
  tell $n A dragon rod
  tell $n A potion of soul-caging
  tell $n and a gem
  tell $n Return to me when you have all these Items.
endif
~
>speech_prog p dragon rod~
if quest(5,1,$n) == 1
  tell $n It's very easy to get one of these rods; you will find them into
  tell $n the General Store in Town.
~
>speech_prog p potion of soul-caging~
if quest(5,1,$n) == 1
  tell $n This is probably the most difficult part:
  tell $n I don't know where to get any of these potions, I don't even know
  tell $n How to prepare it. But probably the Alchemists on the Great Plateau
  tell $n Know how to make it.
~
>speech_prog gem~
if quest(5,1,$n) == 1
  tell $n To have the proper gem you need to go your guild dragon 
  tell $n And ask him of a gem. They will give the right one.
~
>speech_prog threat~
if quest(3,1,$n) == 1
  tell $n There is a mighty human who has been hired by the forces of Evil to
  tell $n destroy the entire breed of lawful dragons... Right now he is looking
  tell $n for a way to enter our town. Probably you already met him in the 
  tell $n Great Plateau. His name is Raul and he's all dressed in black.
  tell $n Kill him and I'll be proud of helping you.
  mpmset $n quest 4 1 1
endif
~
>hitprcnt_prog 5~
mpecho The Platinum Dragon uses his ultimate weapon on $n.
mpecho An ultrasonic wave *** DISINTEGRATES **** $n.
mpquiet on
cast 'acid blast' 
cast 'acid blast' 
cast 'acid blast' 
cast 'acid blast' 
mass acid
mpquiet off
~
>fight_prog 99~
cast 'fireball' 
cast 'heal'
cast 'heal'
~
