>speech_prog p potion of soul caging~
if quest(5,1,$n) == 1
  tell $n Yes... I know of this potion, It's a very ancient formula,
  tell $n To prepare it you need to mix a charm potion, a vial of vampire blood,
  tell $n and potion of induction.
endif
~
>all_greet_prog 99~
if quest(0,1,$n) == 0
  tell $n Sorry, I don't have much time to talk to you...
  tell $n Something really bad has happened. :(
else
  tell $n Hello my dear friend $n. :)
endif
~
>speech_prog p what happened?~
if quest(0,1,$n) == 0
  tell $n One of my best disciples chose the path of Evil. This wouldn't be a 
  tell $n big problem, it happens often; the fact is that he stole an ancient and 
  tell $n important book. But, wait, will you be so kind to HELP me?
endif
~
>speech_prog help~
if quest(0,1,$n) == 0
  tell $n Thanx a lot! You can use any means to get the book back. 
  tell $n I know that he installed a secret laboratory in the eastern part
  tell $n of the Great Plateau. Please find him and bring me the book!
  mpmset $n quest 0 1 1
endif
~
>speech_prog burned~
if quest(1,1,$n) ==1
  tell $n Oh. This is a big loss for our community.
  tell $n At least it's not going to happen again. Anyhow..
  tell $n Thanx for your help. I'll REWARD you.
endif
~
>speech_prog reward~
if quest(1,1,$n) ==1
  tell $n In that book was kept the secret about how to cage the soul of
  tell $n a dragon. I don't remember much about this process, so all I can do 
  tell $n for you now is to grant you access to a city which floats o the clouds 
  tell $n above you where wise and ancient dragons live.
  tell $n Climb over the big rock on the Great Plateau and you'll find your way.
  mpmset $n quest 3 1 1
endif
~
