>all_greet_prog 99~
if quest(0,1,$n) ==1
  tell $n AH! My silly Master sent you to get back the book... Well It's too late!
  tell $n I burned it after learning all its secrets. You will die for 
  tell $n your stupid choice!
  mpmset $n quest 1 1 1
  mpoload 31109
  mpkill $n
  cast 'energy drain' $n
else
  tell $n Who are you? Go away! Nobody invited you here!
endif
