>all_greet_prog 99~
if quest(4,1,$n) ==1
  tell $n So... You decided to the defend that silly population of dragons...
  tell $n You'll pay the consequences of your stupid choice! DIE!
  mpkill $n
else
  if rand(50)
    mpecho $i stares at the sky looking for something.
  else
    grumble 
    mpecho $i murmurs to himself 'Where the hell is the Dragons Hideout?'
  endif
endif
~
>speech_prog p dragons hideout~
tell $n Yes! Somewhere around this Plateau there is a city of lawful dragons.
tell $n I was sent here by my Evil Lord to find their town and destroy their 
tell $n their entire breed; I didn't imagine though the city was hidden so well.
tell $n Go away now! I don't have time to waste!
~
>death_prog 99~
if quest(4,1,$n) == 1
  mpmset $n quest 5 1 1
endif
~
