#31109
diary book~
a diary~
A small book lies on the floor.~
As you read the diary you realize how many cruel experiments the mad
alchemist conducted in his secret hideout. Towards the end of the diary you
get interested in a part where he wrote of a very powerful item that can be
obtained with the collaboration of a great dragon. The procedure involves
the mixing of a potion using the blood of a vampire and making a dragon
drink this potion. If a dragon was never a proper gem his soul would be
caged into it giving the owner of this gem great powers.~
