armchair~
a comfortable armchair~
A very comfortable looking armchair is on the floor here.~
It is a very well shaped armchair covered with red velvet. Getting near to
examine it better start hearing the sound of a flowing stream and the chants
of the little cute birds which live in the happy forests. You feel forced to
try the couch and sit into it; its anatomic shape makes you suddenly feel
better and its fluffiness tells you that you should never stand up...~
