#31114
The Secret Laboratory~
This big natural cavern has been used as a laboratory for the most weird and
cruel experiments. The walls are full of shelves where many books, potions
glass containers and various magical reagents stand in an order that you
can't comprehend. In the back of the cavern a couple of cages are keeping the
corpses of strange crossovers of different animal races.~
