#31117
Alchemists' Shelter~
You are in the middle of the main hall of this shelter for alchemists. There
are many tables where the disciples sit to study or to experiment new weird
and hopefully useful magic items. You do not feel very safe in here, you have
the sensation that something could easily explodes since many of the people
here have huge scars caused by fire on their bodies.~
