#31189
Atop the Northwest Tower of the Golden Castle~
There is not much room on top of the tower. From here can see the whole world
of Mortal Realms. Midgaard, Chakkor, New Chakkor, Mist city, Pompeii, Elven 
City, City of Entropy look really close to each other, but you know that the
roads that connect them are really long; you can also spot the feared Lost 
Citadel in the distance to the east. The sight is so beautiful that you could 
stay here more an entire day completely lost in this beautiful show of
creativity.~
