S
#31191
Hallway to Illusionists Practice Room~
It's a big and large round hallway. A gallery limited by wonderful pink 
marble columns, follows the wall; as you get a closer look you see that it is 
completely covered by paintings showing big fights between dragons and some
of the greatest dragons who chose to be part of the illusionist's guild. The 
bright light of the sun warms this big room entering through a perfectly
constructed glass vault.~
311 ROOM_INDOORS SECT_INSIDE
DDIR_NORTH
You see the illusionists practice room.~
~
0 0 31192
DDIR_SOUTH
You see a road.~
~
0 0 31141
S
#31192
The Illusionists Practice Room~
The room is actually totally burned by failed spells cast by newbie 
illusionists. You wonder how the dome is still standing on these damaged
columns. At the center of the room stands your guildmaster enveloped by a force
shield to protect himself from his adepts.~
311 ROOM_NO_MOB|ROOM_INDOORS|ROOM_ALLOW_ILL SECT_INSIDE
DDIR_SOUTH
You see the entrance to the guild.~
~
0 0 31191
S
#31193
The Dome over the Well of Souls~
You walked into this large hall through the secret passage into the throne.
In the middle of it there is a small well from where you can hear the cries 
of many soul who haven't found peace after their death yet. This place makes 
feel uncomfortable...~
311 ROOM_INDOORS SECT_INSIDE
DDIR_WEST
You see the Throne stage.~
~
